  "description": {
    "type": "/type/text",
    "value": "From the book:\"A stitch in time saves nine.\"  \"O Pris, Pris, I'm really going! Here's the invitation – rough paper - Chapel - spreads - Lyceum Hall - everything splendid; and Jack to take care of me!\"  As Kitty burst into the room and performed a rapturous pas seul, waving the cards over her head, sister Priscilla looked up from her work with a smile of satisfaction on her quiet face."
